{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/tees-valley-combined-authority-best-value-notice-april-2025","content_id":"96e3c1e4-89a9-4262-8c05-6d1e7b8fe32c","description":"Best Value Notice issued to Tees Valley Combined Authority on 3 April 2025.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"67ee45ee53fa8521c3248c30","filename":"Tees_Valley_Combined_Authority_-_Best_Value_Notice.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":300518,"filename":"Tees_Valley_Combined_Authority_-_Best_Value_Notice.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9254006","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Tees Valley Combined Authority: Best Value Notice","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/67ee45ee53fa8521c3248c30/Tees_Valley_Combined_Authority_-_Best_Value_Notice.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"67ee51fde9c76fa33048c6fd","filename":"Letter_from_Minister_McMahon_to_Tees_Valley_Mayor.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":268787,"filename":"Letter_from_Minister_McMahon_to_Tees_Valley_Mayor.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9254007","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Letter from the Minister for Local Government and English Devolution to the Mayor of Tees Valley","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/67ee51fde9c76fa33048c6fd/Letter_from_Minister_McMahon_to_Tees_Valley_Mayor.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69e8dd32d36883a64473b84f","filename":"Letter_from_James_Blythe_to_Tom_Bryant_Tees_Valley_Combined_Authority_Best_Value_Notice.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":164899,"filename":"Letter_from_James_Blythe_to_Tom_Bryant_Tees_Valley_Combined_Authority_Best_Value_Notice.pdf","id":"9254188","isbn":"","number_of_pages":1,"title":"Letter from the Deputy Director of Local Government Stewardship to the Chief Executive of Tees Valley Combined Authority (22 April 2026)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e8dd32d36883a64473b84f/Letter_from_James_Blythe_to_Tom_Bryant_Tees_Valley_Combined_Authority_Best_Value_Notice.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>On 3 April 2025, the Minister for Local Government and English Devolution, Jim McMahon OBE MP, announced in a <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://questions-statements.parliament.uk/written-statements/detail/2025-04-03/hcws576\">written ministerial statement</a> the issuing of a non-statutory best value notice to Tees Valley Combined Authority. This best value notice is a formal notification that the department has concerns regarding the authority and requests that the authority engages with the department to provide assurance of improvement.</p>\n\n<p>A letter was sent to the Authority on 22 April 2026 setting out that the Best Value Notice remains in place until the Department confirms next steps.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Added letter from the Deputy Director of Local Government Stewardship to the Chief Executive of Tees Valley Combined Authority.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-23T11:01:01Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-02T23:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9254006","9254007","9254188"],"first_public_at":"2025-04-03T00:00:00.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"